          %h2#references References
          %p
            Whiskering (though not under this name) of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+transformations"} natural transformations
            is first described in:
          %ul
            %li#Godement58
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Roger+Godement"}> Roger Godement
              , Appendix (pp. 269) of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Topologie algébrique et theorie des faisceaux
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 1252
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.editions-hermann.fr/livre/topologie-algebrique-et-theorie-des-faisceaux-roger-godement"} webpage
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Godement-TopologieAlgebrique.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            For textbook accounts see most of those listed at
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Saunders+MacLane"}> Saunders MacLane
              , §II.5, p. 43 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Categories+for+the+Working+Mathematician"} Categories for the Working Mathematician
              %strong 5
              Springer (1971, second ed. 1997) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-4721-8"}> doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-4721-8
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            For whiskering in
            = succeed ":" do
